{"title":"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Evaluate\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f195e61116886d13ad0e9f400daf6c0e6f5d349f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10}(\\tan 1^{\\circ})+\\log_{10}(\\tan 2^{\\circ})+\\log_{10}(\\tan 3^{\\circ})+\\cdots+\\log_{10}(\\tan 88^{\\circ})+\\log_{10}(\\tan 89^{\\circ}).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"642\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/c/c3c45734f378f9b2ad46385e9596140ba2007365.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 0 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{1}{2}\\log_{10}(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}) \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{1}{2}\\log_{10}2\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 1\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"579\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/a/4ca49594e0c4ec154788a7560d959d177ccae106.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan x \\tan (90^\\circ - x) = \\tan x \\cot x = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"278\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/3/d53fbfdeae683bd5f4800e5ea53522048e3453e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan 45^\\circ = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"87\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/1/7a16402f4ab26d9b4d96f4fe46483a10aeb53f14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log a + \\log b = \\log {ab}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"161\" height=\"16\" />, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/8/75847d3c444c232fb789f66efb6024ee716ce62a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10} {\\tan 1^\\circ \\tan 2^\\circ \\dots \\tan 89^\\circ} = \\log_{10} 1 = 0.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"328\" height=\"17\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/b/9cbe2c62d05dc7dcd0fb02af8528cb43452620b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"44\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/c/84c805a7cdcbc75142d38fc92fdf34f409c582b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log{(\\frac{\\sin 1^\\circ}{\\cos 1^\\circ} \\times \\frac{\\sin 2^\\circ}{\\cos 2^\\circ} \\times ... \\times \\frac{\\sin 89^\\circ}{\\cos 89^\\circ})}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"278\" height=\"39\" />. However, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/d/06d0541226eb5629f42ca656e71f6805e71d22f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin{(x)} = \\cos{(90^\\circ - x)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"172\" height=\"18\" />. Thus each pair of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/b/86be0b29077ff9a37b3b6b3825a408715c497b73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin, \\cos$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"54\" height=\"15\" /> (for example, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/3/6c3b288459c4032e3588ab7dbd360901582bb39f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin{1^\\circ}, \\cos{89^\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"101\" height=\"16\" />) multiplies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Hence we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/b/aebae11d0396487a8b40a695fdd702ad0dfd2068.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log{1} = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME\" title=\"1987 AHSME\">1987 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1987 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1987\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/P